只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Toy Control Protocol for DSH","id":"gh:1334017055","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-toy","slug":"c3ll256/dsh-toy","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Toy Control Protocol for DSH"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-toy"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-toy` is a DeepSeek Harness plugin for connecting small toys to DSH."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"At connection time, the agent first asks for the brand and model, then selects the connection method"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" automatically. If the user genuinely does not know, the agent starts unknown-hardware discovery:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- On macOS, unknown hardware first uses read-only raw **CoreBluetooth** advertisement discovery, wit"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"hout starting Intiface or connecting to devices.\n- Regular Bluetooth, serial, and USB models use **B"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"uttplug / Intiface**. The plugin starts local Intiface Engine automatically when needed.\n- Known sha"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ring-link models from Ankni (安可尼), MizzZee (谜姬), and Zuiqingfeng (醉清风) use **MonsterParty**. Known d"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ual-output devices expose their channels separately."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Users do not need to understand or select an underlying connection method, or manually start Intifac"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ers do not need to understand or select an underlying connection method, or manually start Intiface."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Brand and model names are not an allowlist. The agent passes any user-reported name through unchange"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"d; unfamiliar names still use local hardware discovery. The plugin also supplies a verified local co"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"mpatibility mapping for `RoomFun` devices reporting model `RF_CANNON_PT3`, exposed as **RoomFun Cann"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"on** with one vibration channel."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The implementation follows protocol observations from Chemtrails, together with the device model and"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" message formats documented by Buttplug and the Buttplug Protocol Specification. This repository con"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"tains an independent TypeScript implementation; see NOTICE for attribution."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Guardrails"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Sharing tokens stay in plugin configuration and never appear in model-visible tool arguments or re"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"sults.\n- Raw BLE discovery is read-only: it scans connectable advertisements without connecting or w"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"riting characteristics.\n- Output stops automatically after 30 seconds by default.\n- Zero-duration ho"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"lds are disabled unless `allowHold: true` is explicitly configured.\n- `maxIntensityPercent` and `max"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"DurationSeconds` are enforced before backend dispatch.\n- A newer command replaces the previous autom"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"atic-stop timer for the same device.\n- `toy_stop` without a device id performs a global stop.\n- Plug"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"in unload, HMR, and `toy_disconnect` stop output and await WebSocket shutdown."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Use only hardware you own or are explicitly authorized to control. Treat sharing tokens as temporary"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" control credentials and keep them out of Git, logs, and conversations."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Requirements: Node.js 22.19 or newer and pnpm on `PATH`. Raw macOS BLE discovery additionally uses t"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"he Swift compiler from Xcode Command Line Tools. The bundle targets the `@deepseek-ai/dsh` 0.1.2-rc."},{"id":"p14s3","text":"1 line, which CI installs and boots on every change. Install pnpm once if needed with `npm install -"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"-global pnpm@10`, then add the plugin directly from GitHub:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Start DSH with the same profile:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The first command installs and activates the bundle persistently in the `web` profile. Re-running DS"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"H does not reinstall it. To inspect the composed configuration or remove the bundle:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Replace `web` with another profile name when needed."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"You can tell the agent directly:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"When the brand or model is unknown, say:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"On macOS, the agent first calls `toy_scan_raw_ble`. If the scan exposes a plausible advertised name,"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" it uses that hardware-reported name for `toy_connect`; otherwise it falls back to `unknown`, connec"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ts Intiface automatically, and scans verified protocols. Before scanning, turn the toy on, keep it n"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"earby, and make sure a phone app or another program is not holding the device connection."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Automatic selection and connection"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Before calling `toy_connect`, the agent must ask for the model and pass it to the tool, together wit"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"h the brand when known. When the user does not know, macOS first runs `toy_scan_raw_ble` directly th"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"rough CoreBluetooth. A discovered advertisement name is hardware evidence and may be passed to `toy_"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"connect`; raw BLE ids are never controllable device ids. If raw discovery is unavailable or inconclu"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"sive, the agent passes `unknown` and the system tries the Intiface fallback. The tool never asks the"},{"id":"p28s6","text":" user to select an underlying protocol."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"For a brand or model that is not already documented, the agent follows the same path: pass the repor"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ted text to `toy_connect`, then call `toy_scan`. It must not guess a protocol or write arbitrary BLE"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" characteristics. Discovery returns only devices covered by an upstream Intiface definition or a com"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"patibility mapping that has been verified against hardware. An empty scan means the device remains u"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"nsupported or unavailable, not that the agent should probe it destructively."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"For local Bluetooth, serial, and USB devices, the system first tries an existing Intiface server. If"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" `127.0.0.1:12345` refuses the connection, the plugin runs:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The plugin first looks for Intiface Engine on `PATH`. If it is not installed, it downloads a pinned "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"build from the official Buttplug GitHub Release, verifies its SHA-256 digest, caches it in the user "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"cache directory, and starts it. Set `intifaceAutoDownload: false` to disable downloads or `intifaceE"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"xecutable` to use another path. On disconnect or unload, the plugin stops only the process it starte"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"d; it does not stop an Intiface server that was already running."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- The MonsterParty connection implements the relay behavior and `AKN_DS_SUCKEGG` mapping documented "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"by Chemtrails. Vendor-side protocol changes may require an update.\n- The built-in RoomFun mapping is"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" hardware-verified for BLE name `RoomFun`, model identifier `RF_CANNON_PT3`, firmware `4.3`, and one"},{"id":"p35s4","text":" vibration output. Other RoomFun models are not assumed compatible.\n- Raw BLE advertisement discover"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"y is macOS-only and requires the Swift compiler from Xcode Command Line Tools. It is read-only disco"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"very, not a generic unknown-device control protocol.\n- The Buttplug connection currently exposes sca"},{"id":"p35s7","text":"lar features only; position, direction, sensors, raw access, and subscriptions are outside the curre"},{"id":"p35s8","text":"nt scope.\n- Tests use local protocol fixtures rather than physical hardware.\n- Device ids should be "},{"id":"p35s9","text":"refreshed with `toy_list` after reconnection."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
